# Workflow: Build > Execute Ticket (Dev Story)

<critical>You MUST only start with clean GIT status.</critical>
<critical>You MUST clarify ambiguous requirements BEFORE implementing.</critical>
<critical>You MUST log all issues/decisions in `### DEV AGENT RECORD`.</critical>
<critical>You MUST run all tests (Unit + E2E) before completing.</critical>
<critical>Read `plans/context.yaml` ONCE at start. Do NOT write to context.yaml unless updating ticket status/progress.</critical>

<variables>
  {{current_ticket}} - Read from context.yaml at Step 1
  {{ticket_path}} - Path to the active ticket markdown file
  {{git_status}} - Result of git status check
</variables>

<workflow>

<step n="1" goal="Context Loading & Validation">
  <action>
    **Check Git Status**:
    - Must be clean. If not, HALT.
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] Git Status Clean`
  </action>

  <action>
    **Load Ticket**:
    - Ask user to select ticket (if not current).
    - Update `plans/context.yaml` (`current_ticket`, `status: In Progress`).
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] Ticket Loaded: {{current_ticket}}`
  </action>

  <action>
    **Validate Readiness**:
    - Mode must be `build` or `task`.
    - First unchecked task must exist.
    - Tasks must map to ACs: `(AC: AC-#...)`.
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] Ticket Validated for Execution`
  </action>

  <check if="not ready">
    <critical>STOP. Ticket not ready or invalid mode.</critical>
    <action>Fix ticket or switch mode.</action>
  </check>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 1: Context Loading & Validation**
    [ ✅ ] Git Status Clean
    [ ✅ ] Ticket Loaded: {{current_ticket}}
    [ ✅ ] Ticket Validated for Execution
    
    ➡️ **Beginning Step 2: Execution Loop (Plan -> Implement -> Mark)**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="2" goal="Execution Loop (Plan -> Implement -> Mark)">
  <action>
    **Loop until all tasks [x]:**
    
    **A. Plan**:
    - Read current unchecked task.
    - Write 1-line plan in `### DEV AGENT RECORD`.
    
    **B. Implement**:
    - Write/Edit code.
    - **Log immediately**:
      - `- [Time] [Spec ambiguity] ...`
      - `- [Time] [Bug] ...`
      - `- [Time] [Decision] ...`
    
    **C. Mark**:
    - Check `[x]` task.
    - **Sync ACs**: If all tasks for an AC are done, check `[x]` the corresponding AC in `## Acceptance Criteria`.
    - Add files to `### File List`.
    
    **D. Update Progress**:
    - Update ticket YAML `facets.progress` (e.g., `completed: x`, `total: y`).
    
    **E. Check Next**:
    - If more tasks, repeat A.
  </action>
</step>

<step n="3" goal="Completion & Verification">
  <action>
    **Verify Acceptance Criteria**:
    - Review `## Acceptance Criteria`. Are they met?
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] All ACs Met`
  </action>

  <action>
    **Run All Tests**:
    - Unit (Vitest): Record command + pass/fail + artifact link.
    - E2E (Playwright): Record command + pass/fail + artifact link.
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] Tests Passed (Unit + E2E)`
  </action>

  <check if="tests failed">
    <critical>Cannot complete ticket with failing tests.</critical>
    <action>Fix regressions before proceeding.</action>
  </check>

  <action>
    **Run Build & Lint**:
    - Ensure clean build.
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] Build & Lint Clean`
  </action>

  <action>
    **Taxonomy Drift Check**:
    - If docs touched, check `docs/taxonomy.yaml` for new tags.
  </action>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 3: Completion & Verification**
    [ ✅ ] All ACs Met
    [ ✅ ] Tests Passed (Unit + E2E)
    [ ✅ ] Build & Lint Clean
    
    ➡️ **Beginning Step 4: Handoff**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="4" goal="Handoff">
  <action>
    **Update Ticket**:
    - Status: `Review`.
    - **Final Sync**: Ensure all ACs and Tasks are `[x]`.
    - **Progress Metadata**: Set `facets.progress.completed` to equal `total`.
    - Add `### Completion Notes` to `## Dev Agent Record`.
    - Include: PO Summary, Tech Lead Summary, Evidence Links.
    - Report: `[ ✅ | ❌ ] Ticket Updated to Review`
  </action>

  <output>
    ### Execution Complete
    - **Ticket**: [Link]
    - **Status**: [ ✅ ] Review
    - **Progress**: [ ✅ ] 100% [xxxxxxxxxx]
    - **Tests**: [ ✅ ] Passed (Evidence Attached)
    - **Ready for**: Code Review
  </output>
</step>

</workflow>
